==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno|en}} ''[[ataindre]]'', from {{etyl|fro|en}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} ''{{term|attingo|attingō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-attain.ogg|Audio (US)}}
*: {{rhymes|eɪn}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[accomplish]]; to [[achieve]].
#: ''To '''attain''' such a high level of proficiency requires hours of practice each day.''

